So the correct equation is:

$$(1-s)s_A s_C+s\,s_B-s\,s_A s_C=(1-s)c_C c_A,$$

i.e. $s_A s_C\bigl[(1-s)-s\bigr]+s\,s_B=(1-s)c_C c_A$, so

